# Reown (WalletConnect) project id — create one at https://cloud.reown.com
#
# Set this to enable the full wallet list (WalletConnect QR / desktop deeplinks)
# in the masthead connect dialog. Installed browser wallets are detected through
# EIP-6963 either way; without this id only those can connect.
#
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_.
VITE_REOWN_PROJECT_ID=
